OL,3,AAnger in Kenya over extradition hearing
OL,4,Adelay for ex-British soldier accused of
OL,5,Amurdering woman
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe family of a Kenyan woman allegedly
OL,8,Fmurdered by a former British soldier 14
OL,9,Fyears ago has expressed outrage after
OL,10,Fbeing told an extradition hearing for
OL,11,Fthe accused had been postponed until
OL,12,FMay 2027.
OL,14,FRelatives of Agnes Wanjiru, whose body
OL,15,Fwas found in a septic tank near a
OL,16,FBritish army training camp in Kenya in
OL,17,F2012, described the delay as
OL,18,F"completely unacceptable" and have
OL,19,Faccused the authorities of failing to
OL,20,Fkeep them informed.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
