OL,3,AAnger in Kenya over extradition hearing
OL,4,Adelay for ex-British soldier accused of
OL,5,Amurdering woman
OL,6,
OL,7,FRobert James Purkiss was arrested in
OL,8,Fthe UK last November and is fighting
OL,9,Fextradition to Kenya to face trial for
OL,10,Fthe murder of the 21-year-old mother.
OL,12,FHe denies the allegation. His hearing
OL,13,Fwas due to be held in London next
OL,14,Fmonth.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
